## 5. Threshold Calibration

**Capacity constraint** (`config/capacity.yaml`): up to {{ (capacity_cfg.max_alert_rate_per_month * 100) | round(1) }}% of a segment's customers reviewable per month (floor {{ capacity_cfg.min_alerts_per_month }}, ceiling {{ capacity_cfg.max_alerts_per_month }} alerts/month).

**Selection methodology:** sweep the grid on the tuning period; among grid points whose tuning-period alert volume fits the segment's capacity, select the point maximizing validation-period detection. A segment falls back to the scenario's pooled threshold instead of its own if it has fewer than {{ capacity_cfg.min_tuning_cases_for_segment_specific_threshold }} labeled tuning-period cases, or zero labeled validation-period cases (not enough signal to make a segment-specific decision).

